MANAGER_FORMS+=FmContractPlanogram FmOrgPlanogram FmGoodsValues FmOrgGoodsMatrixEdit 
MANAGER_FORMS+=FmCMonitor FmAgentPlan FmScriptTimeRptParam2 FmScriptTimeRptParam3 FmVisitPlanFact FmScriptTimeRptParam4 DistirbDetail

MANAGER_FORMS+=FmCreateScript VisitControl RemnantsControl FmEditPLU AnswerBoolean AnswerControl AnswerList AnswerSet AnswerSpinner AnswerText
